1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:03,580
Come on, Misaki-kun.

2
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:10,010
Goal! Goal!

3
00:00:10,090 --> 00:00:13,180
Misaki-kun's jumping volley becomes a goal.

4
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:16,930
Good luck, Taro. If you score one more goal, you'll be in the top four.

5
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:31,700
CAPTAIN TSUBASA: JUNIOR YOUTH ARC

6
00:01:48,260 --> 00:01:51,300
The Japan team has equalized the score.

7
00:01:51,390 --> 00:01:54,060
But there's still plenty of time in the second half.

8
00:01:52,970 --> 00:01:57,140
Episode 16: A Battle of Ups and Downs

9
00:01:54,140 --> 00:01:57,980
There's still plenty of time for the teams to determine the outcome.

10
00:02:01,730 --> 00:02:04,190
And with the sound of the whistle, play begins.

11
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:08,110
Diaz!

12
00:02:08,200 --> 00:02:08,860
What is this?

13
00:02:08,950 --> 00:02:13,120
Argentina's captain Diaz launches a solo attack as soon as he gets the ball.

14
00:02:13,200 --> 00:02:15,870
Are you kidding? I definitely won't lose here.

15
00:02:15,950 --> 00:02:22,380
I am the football genius Juan Diaz, and I won't lose to the Japanese!

16
00:02:23,750 --> 00:02:25,880
- Let's do this, Misaki-kun! - Okay!

17
00:02:26,210 --> 00:02:28,760
Tsubasa-kun lunges at him quickly.

18
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:32,890
Diaz dodges to the left.

19
00:02:33,220 --> 00:02:34,140
Not done yet!

20
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:38,390
Tsubasa-kun makes another tackle, but can he get the ball this time?

21
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:42,650
He couldn't! Diaz-kun has passed Tsubasa-kun.

22
00:02:43,020 --> 00:02:45,650
But Misaki-kun got it!

23
00:02:46,070 --> 00:02:47,650
- What!? - Diaz!

24
00:02:47,940 --> 00:02:49,650
Alright, let's go forward, Tsubasa-kun!

25
00:02:49,740 --> 00:02:51,160
Okay, Misaki-kun!

26
00:02:51,660 --> 00:02:53,870
Japan enters Argentina's territory with a counterattack!

27
00:02:53,950 --> 00:02:55,950
Will they be able to change the score?

28
00:02:57,580 --> 00:02:58,410
Diaz.

29
00:02:59,370 --> 00:03:00,500
I can see that,

30
00:03:00,580 --> 00:03:04,340
right now you're acting like Japan's number 10 in the first minutes of the match.

31
00:03:04,790 --> 00:03:10,720
Under great psychological pressure, even superstars can't show their true game.

32
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:16,600
But if you can overcome this crisis, you can become a true superstar.

33
00:03:16,810 --> 00:03:18,810
You can do this, Diaz.

34
00:03:19,350 --> 00:03:21,020
Everyone defend!

35
00:03:22,230 --> 00:03:25,150
Diaz, normally you're the one who saves us!

36
00:03:25,230 --> 00:03:30,150
But this time, each one of us will fight against Japan!

37
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,070
Yes!

38
00:03:32,160 --> 00:03:33,570
Guys...

39
00:03:33,740 --> 00:03:35,030
Tsubasa-kun!

40
00:03:35,950 --> 00:03:36,780
Nice!

41
00:03:36,990 --> 00:03:38,620
- Swarm him! - Cut him off!

42
00:03:38,700 --> 00:03:41,790
What great defending by Argentina!

43
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:43,580
Catch!

44
00:03:43,750 --> 00:03:46,590
They're determined not to let the opponent score another goal.

45
00:03:46,670 --> 00:03:48,760
They're fighting with all their might.

46
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:52,720
But a draw won't take us to the top four.

47
00:03:53,010 --> 00:03:58,430
Get ready, because this battle has only just begun!

48
00:03:58,770 --> 00:04:03,060
Oh! Tsubasa-kun is stopped by a tackle.

49
00:04:03,350 --> 00:04:05,360
And the ball rebounds...

50
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:08,440
Misaki-kun gets it!

51
00:04:08,520 --> 00:04:11,070
We'll stop you even without Diaz!

52
00:04:22,370 --> 00:04:25,960
Incredible! Argentina is defending so aggressively!

53
00:04:26,580 --> 00:04:29,300
The ball rebounds again, and this time it comes to Hyuga-kun!

54
00:04:29,380 --> 00:04:30,840
I won't allow it!

55
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:32,010
What!?

56
00:04:33,720 --> 00:04:36,340
The ball bounced away from both of them!

57
00:04:37,220 --> 00:04:41,100
Seven players are lying on the ground in Argentina's penalty area!

58
00:04:41,180 --> 00:04:43,690
Who will get the loose ball?

59
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:46,810
Get it!

60
00:04:46,900 --> 00:04:51,230
Oh! Argentina's goalkeeper Galtoney-kun rushes in and clears the ball!

61
00:04:51,900 --> 00:04:52,740
What!?

62
00:04:52,820 --> 00:04:57,450
Japan's three musketeers Tsubasa-kun, Misaki-kun, and Hyuga-kun attacked.

63
00:04:57,530 --> 00:05:00,910
But Argentina managed to stop them with spirit and resilience!

64
00:05:02,500 --> 00:05:04,210
We trust you, Diaz!

65
00:05:04,580 --> 00:05:06,920
We don't expect you to carry our burden!

66
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:10,630
We passed the ball to you because we believe in you!

67
00:05:10,750 --> 00:05:12,210
Guys...

68
00:05:12,300 --> 00:05:17,220
Right, there's no need to worry, because they're all looking out for me.

69
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:18,890
Alright!

70
00:05:19,720 --> 00:05:20,720
Let's go!

71
00:05:20,810 --> 00:05:22,430
The ball comes to Diaz-kun!

72
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:24,930
He counterattacks with dribbling!

73
00:05:25,850 --> 00:05:27,480
Juan Diaz.

74
00:05:27,690 --> 00:05:29,860
As the eighth child of a family,

75
00:05:29,940 --> 00:05:35,450
he was born in a poor neighborhood in Buenos Aires, Argentina.

76
00:05:35,700 --> 00:05:40,950
At 9 months old, he began walking and kicking a ball.

77
00:05:42,330 --> 00:05:43,160
What!?

78
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,620
Nitta-kun, Sano-kun!

79
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:47,370
And now, he passes Izawa-kun too!

80
00:05:47,580 --> 00:05:49,170
Damn it! We have to stop him!

81
00:05:49,250 --> 00:05:52,130
We, Japan's defense, will stop you!

82
00:05:52,420 --> 00:05:55,970
Diaz! I've always been behind you!

83
00:05:56,220 --> 00:05:57,430
Pascal...

84
00:06:01,850 --> 00:06:03,180
I'm Pascal.

85
00:06:03,260 --> 00:06:04,720
And I'm Diaz.

86
00:06:04,970 --> 00:06:08,600
At age 5, his older brothers taught him football.

87
00:06:08,690 --> 00:06:11,690
That's when he met Pascal, who lived in the neighborhood.

88
00:06:11,770 --> 00:06:14,480
And together they developed their football skills.

89
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:17,110
They progressed rapidly.

90
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:20,990
They even played alone against 11 players.

91
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,660
Who are these two?

92
00:06:24,330 --> 00:06:25,410
Did you like it?

93
00:06:25,500 --> 00:06:27,540
We did it, Diaz!

94
00:06:27,870 --> 00:06:32,340
At age 12, their talent was discovered by a local club.

95
00:06:32,460 --> 00:06:34,380
If Pascal comes, I'll come too.

96
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:35,630
Diaz.

97
00:06:35,710 --> 00:06:40,130
If you don't want to, I've had other offers too.

98
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:42,260
I told a small lie...

99
00:06:42,890 --> 00:06:45,140
Alright, we're signing contracts with both of you.

100
00:06:45,220 --> 00:06:46,810
Great!

101
00:06:46,930 --> 00:06:50,400
Diaz enters the opponent's territory!

102
00:06:50,650 --> 00:06:52,270
He faces Brave Mr. Ishizaki!

103
00:06:53,110 --> 00:06:55,530
And now giant Jito-kun.

104
00:06:55,610 --> 00:06:56,900
He passed them too!

105
00:06:56,980 --> 00:06:57,860
What!?

106
00:06:57,940 --> 00:07:01,070
Forward hunter Soda-kun launches his sharp tackle!

107
00:07:03,070 --> 00:07:06,660
Incredible! Diaz-kun passes him too!

108
00:07:06,740 --> 00:07:07,580
What!?

109
00:07:08,450 --> 00:07:10,460
When Diaz was 13,

110
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:14,380
the club teams won the under-14 tournament.

111
00:07:14,460 --> 00:07:16,840
And he made Argentina champions.

112
00:07:16,920 --> 00:07:19,380
He had already surpassed his brothers in football skills.

113
00:07:19,470 --> 00:07:22,430
And every time he won a tournament, he received a small prize.

114
00:07:22,510 --> 00:07:25,430
And since his older brothers started working,

115
00:07:25,510 --> 00:07:28,890
everything became easier for Diaz's family.

116
00:07:29,520 --> 00:07:33,310
At age 15, he was selected for the Argentine youth team.

117
00:07:33,400 --> 00:07:35,480
And he was appointed as captain.

118
00:07:35,570 --> 00:07:41,610
A professional club wanted to use him as a regular player next season.

119
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:43,990
His first professional match,

120
00:07:44,070 --> 00:07:47,830
just like that other Argentine legend, was at age 15.

121
00:07:47,910 --> 00:07:49,120
What is this!?

122
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:53,330
He also passed Japan's last defender Matsuyama-kun.

123
00:07:53,420 --> 00:07:54,630
- No! - Damn it!

124
00:07:54,960 --> 00:07:57,710
Now he's face to face with the goalkeeper!

125
00:07:58,210 --> 00:08:00,720
Wakashimazu-kun rushes out from the goal without hesitation!

126
00:08:06,350 --> 00:08:07,600
Wow!

127
00:08:07,890 --> 00:08:11,480
Diaz-kun dribbles past Wakashimazu-kun too!

128
00:08:11,770 --> 00:08:15,360
U-Unbelievable! He got past 8 opponents!

129
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:19,480
Diaz-kun passes 8 players and shoots at the empty goal!

130
00:08:19,610 --> 00:08:24,410
4-3! Argentina once again takes the lead against Japan!

131
00:08:24,490 --> 00:08:26,660
The genius Diaz-kun is back!

132
00:08:26,740 --> 00:08:29,620
This is his fourth solo goal in this match!

133
00:08:29,790 --> 00:08:32,000
I did it, guys! Did you see?

134
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:34,170
This is how the genius Juan Diaz plays!

135
00:08:34,250 --> 00:08:35,790
You were amazing, Diaz!

136
00:08:35,880 --> 00:08:37,250
You're number one!

137
00:08:37,630 --> 00:08:39,000
Did you see, Japan!?

138
00:08:39,090 --> 00:08:41,380
Now you know what Diaz can do!

139
00:08:41,460 --> 00:08:45,390
As long as you're here, Argentina doesn't lose!

140
00:08:45,680 --> 00:08:50,260
Everyone on the field and the crowd cheered as if they had won!

141
00:08:50,520 --> 00:08:57,360
Diaz achieved this success because he knew his teammates had his back.

142
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:59,270
This is a precious goal.

143
00:09:00,020 --> 00:09:03,070
The rest of the game is now under control.

144
00:09:04,490 --> 00:09:07,240
He got past 8 players all by himself.

145
00:09:07,660 --> 00:09:09,280
Sorry, guys.

146
00:09:10,160 --> 00:09:11,700
When we brought the game to a tie,

147
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:17,380
I wanted to take the lead right away and didn't mark Diaz.

148
00:09:17,790 --> 00:09:20,880
Tsubasa, it's not your fault.

149
00:09:21,050 --> 00:09:25,050
The ones to blame are us who let him get past.

150
00:09:25,430 --> 00:09:27,550
Eight players all by himself.

151
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:29,600
Diaz is truly a professional.

152
00:09:32,100 --> 00:09:36,060
But I... we... haven't lost yet!

153
00:09:36,270 --> 00:09:39,560
We'll tie it up again, and then score the winning goal!

154
00:09:40,190 --> 00:09:41,320
Tsubasa.

155
00:09:41,650 --> 00:09:44,610
Tsubasa-kun is right, we still have time.

156
00:09:44,690 --> 00:09:47,700
We'll keep fighting for victory until time runs out.

157
00:09:47,910 --> 00:09:49,570
- Misaki-kun. - Misaki...

158
00:09:49,990 --> 00:09:51,160
Right.

159
00:09:51,330 --> 00:09:56,160
They think they've already won, but we'll prove them wrong.

160
00:09:56,540 --> 00:09:58,170
Pass the ball to me, Tsubasa.

161
00:09:58,250 --> 00:10:00,290
This time, I'll score.

162
00:10:00,420 --> 00:10:01,590
Hyuga.

163
00:10:02,050 --> 00:10:03,630
Okay, Hyuga-kun.

164
00:10:04,050 --> 00:10:05,720
Alright, get ready guys!

165
00:10:06,010 --> 00:10:07,510
Okay!

166
00:10:09,680 --> 00:10:11,390
- Ishizaki. - Huh?

167
00:10:12,390 --> 00:10:15,980
I think this is why Nankatsu won three years in a row.

168
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:19,980
Huh? Why did you suddenly say that?

169
00:10:20,060 --> 00:10:21,650
Nothing.

170
00:10:22,070 --> 00:10:22,980
It's just...

171
00:10:23,610 --> 00:10:27,900
After playing on the same team as Tsubasa, I felt this feeling.

172
00:10:29,110 --> 00:10:34,200
As long as he's with us, we can handle whatever comes our way.

173
00:10:34,790 --> 00:10:39,000
He makes us feel that we can win if we play with all our strength.

174
00:10:39,580 --> 00:10:41,500
Together with that number 10.

175
00:10:40,540 --> 00:10:42,920
CAPTAIN TSUBASA: JUNIOR YOUTH ARC

176
00:10:45,690 --> 00:10:47,940
Born: October 25 | Height: 165 cm | Weight: 53 kg | Blood Type: O

177
00:10:50,490 --> 00:10:51,450
Tsubasa-san!

178
00:10:51,570 --> 00:10:53,110
The game continues.

179
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:56,830
Will the Japan team be able to break through Argentina's energetic defense?

180
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:58,830
We trust you, Tsubasa!

181
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:01,500
They have placed all their hopes

182
00:11:01,580 --> 00:11:04,460
on their captain and playmaker Tsubasa-kun!

183
00:11:06,540 --> 00:11:10,380
The ball is at Tsubasa-kun's feet, and Diaz-kun immediately applies pressure!

184
00:11:10,470 --> 00:11:12,340
This is like before.

185
00:11:12,430 --> 00:11:15,140
I'll steal your ball and go two goals ahead.

186
00:11:15,930 --> 00:11:18,010
Let's save our duel for later.

187
00:11:18,180 --> 00:11:20,270
Tsubasa-kun decides to pass!

188
00:11:20,430 --> 00:11:21,350
What!?

189
00:11:22,060 --> 00:11:23,900
The ball goes to Misaki-kun!

190
00:11:25,020 --> 00:11:27,020
- Stop him! - Okay!

191
00:11:27,400 --> 00:11:28,230
This isn't good!

192
00:11:28,320 --> 00:11:30,610
They won't let me get past easily anymore.

193
00:11:30,940 --> 00:11:31,780
Tsubasa-kun!

194
00:11:32,150 --> 00:11:35,450
Misaki-kun passes the ball back to Tsubasa-kun!

195
00:11:36,570 --> 00:11:40,620
Hyuga-san! Tsubasa-san, pass the ball to Hyuga-san!

196
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:42,040
Takeshi.

197
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:45,080
Hyuga-san has the ability to score goals.

198
00:11:45,420 --> 00:11:47,380
But that's not all.

199
00:11:47,540 --> 00:11:49,170
Before the national cup,

200
00:11:49,300 --> 00:11:52,420
to defeat Nankatsu and Tsubasa-san,

201
00:11:52,510 --> 00:11:56,010
Hyuga-san underwent Coach Kira's intense training in Okinawa.

202
00:11:56,180 --> 00:12:00,010
With the Tiger Shot he created, Toho won its first championship.

203
00:12:00,470 --> 00:12:03,890
And now, his goal is to become a forward who can compete on the world stage.

204
00:12:04,640 --> 00:12:07,610
Since we got here, with him,

205
00:12:07,690 --> 00:12:11,650
he's been training with that super heavy black ball that Coach Kira sent.

206
00:12:12,570 --> 00:12:14,450
That's why it has to be Hyuga-san.

207
00:12:14,740 --> 00:12:18,910
Japan needs Hyuga-san's skills to score goals!

208
00:12:19,870 --> 00:12:22,750
Tsubasa-kun knows this well right now.

209
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:24,410
Misugi-san.

210
00:12:24,710 --> 00:12:29,170
But right now Argentina is defending wonderfully.

211
00:12:29,420 --> 00:12:33,670
Whether Hyuga can score depends on us creating an opportunity for him.

212
00:12:34,510 --> 00:12:35,630
Yes.

213
00:12:36,380 --> 00:12:37,800
Hurry up, number 10!

214
00:12:37,930 --> 00:12:41,060
You can never score without getting past me!

215
00:12:41,890 --> 00:12:43,560
Your words don't provoke me.

216
00:12:44,100 --> 00:12:45,440
This kid...

217
00:12:45,690 --> 00:12:47,020
I want to go forward.

218
00:12:47,100 --> 00:12:49,940
Matsuyama! Do you want to make an overlapping run!?

219
00:12:50,020 --> 00:12:53,280
This didn't work in the Italy match and we conceded a goal.

220
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:56,950
So what? Do you expect us to just stand here and do nothing!?

221
00:12:57,360 --> 00:13:00,950
We defenders can do more than just defend!

222
00:13:01,580 --> 00:13:03,080
Matsuyama.

223
00:13:03,580 --> 00:13:06,210
What's this? Matsuyama-kun is pushing forward!

224
00:13:06,540 --> 00:13:07,710
Matsuyama-kun!

225
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:08,830
Now!

226
00:13:09,500 --> 00:13:11,590
Tsubasa-kun makes a pass and goes!

227
00:13:12,130 --> 00:13:13,840
He passes the ball to Matsuyama-kun.

228
00:13:13,920 --> 00:13:16,260
And runs toward the opponent's goal!

229
00:13:16,380 --> 00:13:17,720
What will you do, Diaz?

230
00:13:17,800 --> 00:13:19,090
Will you chase after me?

231
00:13:19,470 --> 00:13:20,550
Or won't you...?

232
00:13:21,600 --> 00:13:22,720
Okay!

233
00:13:25,020 --> 00:13:27,640
It must be easier than facing the number 10!

234
00:13:27,730 --> 00:13:29,480
I'll steal the ball and score the fifth goal!

235
00:13:30,190 --> 00:13:32,190
Diaz goes after Matsuyama.

236
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:34,820
And after I ran toward the goal, I got marked.

237
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:38,070
But this means Hyuga-kun is more free.

238
00:13:38,490 --> 00:13:40,110
Now only Matsuyama-kun remains...

239
00:13:40,870 --> 00:13:42,870
We trust his ball keeping!

240
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:46,250
This is a one-on-one battle between Matsuyama-kun and Diaz-kun!

241
00:13:47,040 --> 00:13:48,920
Don't worry, Matsuyama!

242
00:13:49,370 --> 00:13:52,000
While you're forward, we'll defend!

243
00:13:52,090 --> 00:13:54,000
Don't worry if he steals the ball!

244
00:13:55,050 --> 00:13:56,210
Guys...

245
00:13:56,760 --> 00:13:57,760
And also...

246
00:13:58,420 --> 00:14:01,180
Tsubasa trusted me a lot by passing the ball to me.

247
00:14:02,550 --> 00:14:03,510
Diaz.

248
00:14:04,140 --> 00:14:07,350
I may not be very talented, but when it comes to ball keeping,

249
00:14:07,430 --> 00:14:09,020
I, Hikaru Matsuyama,

250
00:14:09,600 --> 00:14:14,900
can fight as hard as the genius of Japanese football, Ozora Tsubasa!

251
00:14:15,230 --> 00:14:16,570
I'll catch it!

252
00:14:16,650 --> 00:14:20,530
And no one can beat me in persistence and determination!

253
00:14:21,280 --> 00:14:22,120
What!?

254
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:26,290
Incredible, Matsuyama-kun blocks the ball with his knee and prevents him from taking it!

255
00:14:26,790 --> 00:14:29,620
Go forward, Tsubasa!

256
00:14:32,290 --> 00:14:33,960
I leave the rest to you!

257
00:14:34,040 --> 00:14:37,420
Send this to Argentina's goal once again!

258
00:14:38,010 --> 00:14:40,930
Matsuyama-kun passes with an Eagle shot!

259
00:14:41,300 --> 00:14:43,430
It's going toward Tsubasa-kun!

260
00:14:43,680 --> 00:14:44,550
Impossible!

261
00:14:44,850 --> 00:14:46,720
Matsuyama-kun, thank you.

262
00:14:46,970 --> 00:14:49,480
I promise I won't waste this pass!

263
00:14:50,180 --> 00:14:51,810
Catch, Hyuga-kun!

264
00:14:51,890 --> 00:14:54,690
Tsubasa-kun passes with the sole!

265
00:14:55,770 --> 00:14:59,190
A final pass for Hyuga-kun running toward the goal!

266
00:14:59,530 --> 00:15:00,700
Stop him!

267
00:15:00,990 --> 00:15:01,860
Hyuga!

268
00:15:01,950 --> 00:15:03,700
We trust you, Hyuga, score!

269
00:15:04,030 --> 00:15:06,120
If I can't score...

270
00:15:06,530 --> 00:15:08,700
Then I'm not the best forward!

271
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:12,870
Hyuga trained with Coach Kira's famous black ball.

272
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:17,710
But it didn't just strengthen his Tiger Shot.

273
00:15:18,380 --> 00:15:24,220
It also increased his skill, running speed, and even jumping height.

274
00:15:24,300 --> 00:15:29,970
With these three new abilities, Kojiro Hyuga is a wild tiger!

275
00:15:30,060 --> 00:15:33,810
Come on, go into Argentina's goal!

276
00:15:33,900 --> 00:15:37,480
This is Hyuga's tiger header dive!

277
00:15:39,610 --> 00:15:41,280
Goal!

278
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:44,490
Japan equalizes the score once again!

279
00:15:44,660 --> 00:15:45,570
Hyuga-kun!

280
00:15:45,660 --> 00:15:46,490
Hyuga!

281
00:15:46,820 --> 00:15:50,290
Tsubasa-kun passes and Hyuga-kun scores!

282
00:15:50,370 --> 00:15:53,250
This duo's second combination in this match!

283
00:15:53,330 --> 00:15:57,500
And it all started with defender Matsuyama-kun.

284
00:15:57,840 --> 00:15:59,840
We tied it up with them, Hyuga-kun!

285
00:15:59,920 --> 00:16:02,510
Yes, the real battle begins now!

286
00:16:02,590 --> 00:16:03,420
Yes!

287
00:16:03,800 --> 00:16:06,390
You were great, Tsubasa-kun, Kojiro!

288
00:16:06,890 --> 00:16:09,180
Matsuyama, you played great!

289
00:16:09,260 --> 00:16:10,390
Yes!

290
00:16:10,470 --> 00:16:14,520
In the 19th minute of the second half, Japan youth ties it up again!

291
00:16:14,600 --> 00:16:16,190
This is truly a battle of ups and downs!

292
00:16:16,270 --> 00:16:17,900
Who knows how it will end?

293
00:16:18,400 --> 00:16:20,400
Not just number 10.

294
00:16:20,940 --> 00:16:23,190
Number 12's ball keeping ability.

295
00:16:23,360 --> 00:16:26,490
Number 9's shooting power.

296
00:16:27,200 --> 00:16:30,950
They've improved so much since they played against Germany.

297
00:16:31,700 --> 00:16:32,750
That's it!

298
00:16:32,830 --> 00:16:36,620
Tsubasa-kun gave the ball to Matsuyama-kun because he knew

299
00:16:36,710 --> 00:16:38,710
how strong he is at ball keeping.

300
00:16:39,340 --> 00:16:41,670
That's what allowed us to score this goal.

301
00:16:41,750 --> 00:16:43,720
Tsubasa-san is incredible!

302
00:16:43,920 --> 00:16:45,430
Sawada, Misugi.

303
00:16:46,050 --> 00:16:49,430
Warm up. One of you will enter the field before the end.

304
00:16:49,850 --> 00:16:51,350
O-Okay.

305
00:16:52,930 --> 00:16:53,930
Misugi-san!?

306
00:16:54,350 --> 00:16:55,180
Misugi.

307
00:16:57,190 --> 00:16:58,310
Okay!

308
00:17:01,730 --> 00:17:02,860
Diaz.

309
00:17:03,190 --> 00:17:05,320
They don't give up.

310
00:17:05,700 --> 00:17:09,570
Today we are not facing a simple Asian team.

311
00:17:10,450 --> 00:17:13,240
I'm fighting against Japan, a country that wants to win just like us.

312
00:17:14,620 --> 00:17:17,080
Let's fight with determination like them!

313
00:17:17,460 --> 00:17:19,330
Like them, we'll fight with all our strength!

314
00:17:19,580 --> 00:17:20,590
Yes!

315
00:17:20,670 --> 00:17:22,590
You're right, Diaz!

316
00:17:23,420 --> 00:17:24,590
Tsubasa.

317
00:17:25,130 --> 00:17:27,180
You've really progressed.

318
00:17:27,510 --> 00:17:31,010
The Tsubasa I knew was a forward.

319
00:17:31,300 --> 00:17:32,810
Captain Tsubasa is not just a great scorer,

320
00:17:32,890 --> 00:17:36,060
but also a player who lifts up his teammates.

321
00:17:36,770 --> 00:17:38,310
Now he is

322
00:17:38,390 --> 00:17:44,230
a player who leads the team by showcasing the unique strengths and talents of his teammates.

323
00:17:44,690 --> 00:17:50,200
In the notebook I left you, I told you to become a midfielder.

324
00:17:51,200 --> 00:17:56,200
You achieved that and even exceeded my expectations.

325
00:17:56,290 --> 00:17:58,790
And you became an extraordinary midfielder.

326
00:18:00,080 --> 00:18:03,170
Even without me, you...

327
00:18:04,130 --> 00:18:06,010
10 minutes left.

328
00:18:06,090 --> 00:18:10,220
A draw is enough for Argentina to advance to the top four.

329
00:18:10,470 --> 00:18:14,930
But Japan needs a victory here to advance.

330
00:18:17,520 --> 00:18:19,100
Get ready, guys!

331
00:18:19,190 --> 00:18:20,140
Okay!

332
00:18:20,560 --> 00:18:22,900
Argentina doesn't want a draw.

333
00:18:22,980 --> 00:18:24,980
They want to win!

334
00:18:25,070 --> 00:18:27,190
What a magnificent battle this has been.

335
00:18:27,690 --> 00:18:30,240
Again Diaz-kun leads the attack!

336
00:18:31,280 --> 00:18:34,160
Japan marks Diaz-kun with Tsubasa-kun!

337
00:18:35,620 --> 00:18:39,580
Diaz-kun keeps advancing despite Tsubasa-kun's intense pressure.

338
00:18:40,250 --> 00:18:42,250
Juan Diaz is a true genius!

339
00:18:42,750 --> 00:18:43,710
Now!

340
00:18:44,040 --> 00:18:46,460
Tsubasa makes a side tackle!

341
00:18:46,710 --> 00:18:48,210
The ball gets away!

342
00:18:48,420 --> 00:18:49,970
Shoot, Pascal!

343
00:18:51,010 --> 00:18:52,590
Let it be a goal!

344
00:18:52,680 --> 00:18:54,600
Pascal-kun shoots!

345
00:18:54,760 --> 00:18:57,600
Goalkeeper Wakashimazu saves with a dive!

346
00:18:58,390 --> 00:18:59,350
Nice!

347
00:18:59,850 --> 00:19:01,890
Go forward, guys!

348
00:19:02,230 --> 00:19:04,520
Now it's Japan's turn to attack!

349
00:19:04,690 --> 00:19:06,440
The ball comes to Misaki-kun!

350
00:19:08,820 --> 00:19:12,450
Every time Japan scored, this kid had a contribution.

351
00:19:13,030 --> 00:19:14,410
In this situation...

352
00:19:16,780 --> 00:19:17,660
Diaz!

353
00:19:18,040 --> 00:19:19,410
I'll handle it, number 10.

354
00:19:19,700 --> 00:19:23,790
Oh, this time Diaz-kun marks Tsubasa-kun!

355
00:19:24,210 --> 00:19:27,380
Now Misaki-kun becomes Japan's backup playmaker.

356
00:19:27,460 --> 00:19:28,920
We trust you, Misaki!

357
00:19:29,300 --> 00:19:30,210
Catch!

358
00:19:31,420 --> 00:19:32,260
What!?

359
00:19:32,760 --> 00:19:37,810
Misaki-kun sends a precise pass to Hyuga-kun running deep behind the opponent's defense.

360
00:19:38,060 --> 00:19:39,270
Great, Misaki!

361
00:19:39,970 --> 00:19:41,020
Catch him!

362
00:19:41,100 --> 00:19:42,730
He makes another pass!

363
00:19:42,810 --> 00:19:46,440
Hyuga-kun didn't shoot and sent the ball over the goal!

364
00:19:46,650 --> 00:19:47,480
Cut him off!

365
00:19:47,570 --> 00:19:49,110
Block his shot!

366
00:19:49,190 --> 00:19:50,030
Nice!

367
00:19:51,490 --> 00:19:52,320
Catch!

368
00:19:52,650 --> 00:19:54,610
Nitta-kun passes back!

369
00:19:55,030 --> 00:19:57,160
The ball comes to Sano-kun.

370
00:19:57,240 --> 00:19:58,080
Score!

371
00:19:58,160 --> 00:19:59,620
And he shoots!

372
00:20:00,410 --> 00:20:01,250
So close!

373
00:20:01,330 --> 00:20:03,870
What a save by Galtoney-kun!

374
00:20:03,960 --> 00:20:06,130
- Damn it! - Great job, goalkeeper!

375
00:20:06,500 --> 00:20:07,420
We're going forward!

376
00:20:07,500 --> 00:20:09,880
Once again the ball is with Argentina!

377
00:20:10,340 --> 00:20:13,510
There are constant back-and-forth attacks between the two teams!

378
00:20:13,800 --> 00:20:17,050
Diaz marks Tsubasa, who has 4 assists.

379
00:20:17,550 --> 00:20:20,010
This makes it hard to score.

380
00:20:20,560 --> 00:20:24,270
If we're going to win with Hyuga who scored two goals...

381
00:20:24,850 --> 00:20:27,110
Should I put Sawada on the field?

382
00:20:28,110 --> 00:20:29,520
Or maybe...

383
00:20:31,440 --> 00:20:33,150
You can do it, Argentina!

384
00:20:33,240 --> 00:20:35,150
One more goal, Diaz!

385
00:20:35,320 --> 00:20:36,610
Don't lose, Japan!

386
00:20:36,700 --> 00:20:38,570
Just 1 more goal!

387
00:20:38,990 --> 00:20:42,040
Both teams' cheer squads are cheering with all their might!

388
00:20:42,120 --> 00:20:46,250
This battle has excited the entire stadium.

389
00:20:47,710 --> 00:20:50,750
Only 5 minutes left, now or never!

390
00:20:50,840 --> 00:20:53,340
Both teams' stars and captains are marking each other.

391
00:20:53,420 --> 00:20:56,340
And they can't create scoring opportunities.

392
00:20:56,430 --> 00:20:57,300
Diaz!

393
00:20:57,390 --> 00:20:58,970
I won't lose, number 10!

394
00:20:59,300 --> 00:21:02,020
The other players aren't backing down either!

395
00:21:02,100 --> 00:21:04,480
What a tremendous battle of wills!

396
00:21:05,850 --> 00:21:06,850
Good.

397
00:21:08,020 --> 00:21:11,020
The ball goes out of play and it's in Argentina's favor.

398
00:21:13,190 --> 00:21:14,110
What's this?

399
00:21:14,650 --> 00:21:17,360
It looks like Japan is changing its formation.

400
00:21:19,490 --> 00:21:22,240
In place of number 18 Nitta-kun,

401
00:21:22,620 --> 00:21:24,830
the player wearing the number 24 jersey...

402
00:21:28,250 --> 00:21:29,630
Misugi-kun!

403
00:21:29,960 --> 00:21:32,210
Jun Misugi-kun enters the field!

404
00:21:32,500 --> 00:21:34,260
Misugi-san, good luck!

405
00:21:34,340 --> 00:21:35,340
Thanks!

406
00:21:35,420 --> 00:21:37,130
The glass baby...

407
00:21:37,340 --> 00:21:39,680
The extraordinarily talented young man of the field, Jun Misugi!

408
00:21:39,760 --> 00:21:42,970
Could he be Japan's secret weapon?

409
00:21:43,390 --> 00:21:45,520
In the European friendship tournament,

410
00:21:45,600 --> 00:21:49,770
even in this tournament, Misugi-kun hasn't played in any match for the Japan team.

411
00:21:49,850 --> 00:21:51,690
And this is his first match against Argentina.

412
00:21:51,900 --> 00:21:55,400
He's stepping onto the field for the first time!

413
00:21:55,650 --> 00:21:56,900
Misugi-san!

414
00:21:57,200 --> 00:21:58,150
Misugi!

415
00:21:58,650 --> 00:21:59,950
Misugi-kun!

416
00:22:00,990 --> 00:22:06,540
Tsubasa-kun, I'm finally standing on the field with you.

417
00:23:46,000 --> 00:24:49,950
NEXT EPISODE: THE FIELD'S YOUNG NOBLE RETURNS!!